algorithm:
{
New algorithm: Assign priority based on the remaining capacity after adding the item, preferring bins where the item fits perfectly or leaves minimal positive remaining capacity, while heavily penalizing overflows.
}

function:
def priority(item: float, bins: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
    remaining = bins - item
    penalty = -1e9
    return np.where(remaining >= 0, -np.abs(remaining - item), penalty)

def priority(item: float, bins: np.ndarray) -> np.ndarray:
    penalty = -1e9
    avg_remaining = np.mean(bins)
    return np.where(bins >= item, -np.abs(bins - avg_remaining), penalty)
